WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.231
Keep the subcontractor and the work together.

00:00:03.231 --> 00:00:08.408
Move from the company record to related
opportunities, then inspect its recorded quotes.

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:12.026
Contacts, conversations, and pricing remain
connected.

00:00:12.026 --> 00:00:15.997
Subcontractor outreach is optional and follows
your company's rules.

00:00:15.997 --> 00:00:18.553
No outreach is sent in this demonstration.
